# 💻 Practice 2 — Even Numbers

```python
numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]

result = {i for i in numbers if i % 2 == 0}

print(result)
```

### Output Values

```text
2, 4, 6, 8
```

### Logic

```text
Take each number
      ↓
Check if it is even
      ↓
Store it in the set
```

